{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0183_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ab5ecc8f0936112a0608e17b0714786d05fc43bc8fa0c672cb456d04729dc2a3", "ja": "（今日は千早が、生放送の音楽番組に出演中だ。\n新曲のいい宣伝になると、本人もはりきっている）", "zh": "（今天千早正在参加现场直播的音乐节目。她本人也干劲十足，因为这会是宣传新歌的好机会。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0183_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "821a0bd0f2023b195daa77da50c265c9f446d034015e278962765d5089368310", "ja": "……ええ、そうなんです。まだレッスンが始まった\nばかりなので、詳しくは言えないのですが。", "zh": "……是的，正是如此。因为才刚刚开始练习，\n还不能透露太多细节就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0183_1002_002chi", "source_sha256": "2932c62055c882c4078e5a0b9aefe1736c3cc722b1f8d682d46b25103b6eb9e4", "ja": "でも、形は、見えてきました。\n素敵な歌になることは、間違いないかと。", "zh": "不过，已经渐渐有眉目了。\n我敢肯定，一定会成为一首动听的歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0183_1003_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "a5f6d386e12629fe6430bb1cdfc6e44f7f4a95b068d3f7d8a821932ef5a9cd81", "ja": "なるほど、それは期待できそうだね！\n新曲はデュエットと聞いたけど、お相手は？", "zh": "原来如此，看来很值得期待呢！\n听说新歌是二重唱，对方是谁？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0183_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "55db5e31e89377ce0b5e9822a5e74155ea1b82ffcc7075fa3cbf9985abc7c2c1", "ja": "はい。同じ事務所の、最上静香さんです。\nご存知の方もいらっしゃるとは思いますが……。", "zh": "是的，是同事务所的最上静香小姐。\n我想应该也有人认识她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0183_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "e0768a83d646c9cf2dfd6f37f5559eb9182e251e149ea621d98ef489c3c942cf", "ja": "本当に、素晴らしい歌声の持ち主なので。皆さんの前で\n一緒に歌えるのを、楽しみにしています！", "zh": "因为她的歌声真的非常美妙。我很期待能在大家面前和她一起歌唱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0183_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f86f58780b8968972e659555ec55f98a1d053dcd26023f5eb2b0169fae7d48ed", "ja": "（千早、ちょっとトークが固いかな。\nまあでも上手く回ってるし、心配はいらないか）", "zh": "（千早，说话是不是有点太拘谨了。不过进行得很顺利，应该不用担心吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0183_1007_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "d7d6177f2b85c343ace7103f4d833a65cb07cfcbe73f84e4143cb5a62c553294", "ja": "それじゃあ、千早ちゃん。\n画面の向こうのファンに、メッセージを！", "zh": "那么，千早。\n给屏幕另一端的粉丝们留言吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0183_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "5be7edcfad8d1e54fc01289738787c9da56dab4c61bd186be4227fd4705b43db", "ja": "はい。ええと……皆さん。\nいつも応援、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "好的。那个……各位。\n一直以来，谢谢大家的支持。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0183_1009_002chi", "source_sha256": "8e7ac97673d5424339a7404f2f1a56fc40d4265c46027822d5df59fc4f0cdef8", "ja": "きっと……いえ、絶対に。最高のパフォーマンスを\nお届けします。楽しみにしていてください。", "zh": "一定……不，我一定会把最精彩的演出\n带给大家。请期待吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0183_1010_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "4dc891a4a4bed17693ff3b73153c88369b1cded40e6866fe880ceca0469339e7", "ja": "あはは、千早ちゃん、本当に真面目だね！\nでも、みんなもうちょっと笑顔が見たいんじゃない？", "zh": "啊哈哈，千早真是太认真了！\n不过，大家不是想看到更多一些笑容吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0183_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "f81d6f74c502d96ffb09ac171901224b9bf02beda8a146a4a1962e6b726e3a15", "ja": "あっ……そうですよね。\nすみません、笑顔を……", "zh": "啊……确实是这样。\n抱歉，我会露出笑容……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0183_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "81519d294dda4ce9e57129da877854fe26c7cc74d180a44bdef90384e4e0a10b", "ja": "笑顔、を……。", "zh": "笑容……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0183_1013_p", "source_sha256": "7a20982abc503716211c4faec876034c8b79834a63d7c00e88b333946f40fc58", "ja": "（む？　千早がこっちを見て……はっ！　そうか、\nこれは千早からのSOSだ！　ここは……）", "zh": "（嗯？千早在看这边……啊！原来如此，这是千早发来的求救信号！那这里就……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0183_1014", "source_sha256": "7b58c51b76efea93053b8afcf5d2b7812bc4461f355c370eef6387de5cc9af89", "ja": "変顔をする", "zh": "做鬼脸", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0183_2000_p", "source_sha256": "8d2edbf33f159d530f46cde8c47106ffa9dba36e925c28bf2a320aca1b0af439", "ja": "グバァ。", "zh": "咕哇。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0183_2001_002chi", "source_sha256": "eccaaaba4592afca65ab5e1be8497f6e07430085e47fdbf11f2ce16fdbfb9f0c", "ja": "ぷっ！？　ふ、ふふ……ふふふっ！　あははっ！\nあ、あはははは！", "zh": "噗！？　呵、呵呵……呵呵呵！啊哈哈！\n啊、啊哈哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0183_2002_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "ebf8ee1e243e207daef4847aca13697a67de0c95897aa02d276549ca271b9a04", "ja": "千早ちゃん！？　突然どうしたの！", "zh": "千早！？突然怎么了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0183_2003_002chi", "source_sha256": "94f9a1c3722275ef089e1f69de24767c0a31512799d007ade27a55dedf7b6d5d", "ja": "ご、ごめんなさ、ふふっ……ちょっと、あの……。\nお、思い出し笑いを……ふ、ふふふ、ふふふふふっ！", "zh": "对、对不起，呵呵……就是，有点那个……\n想、想起了好笑的事……呵、呵呵呵，呵呵呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0183_2004_p", "source_sha256": "5c068c8f8369694cd958d76601b366d9c31a1c56e2c759d8be914599faf7f2a3", "ja": "（しまった、ツボに入ってしまったみたいだ……。\nまあでも、いい笑顔だぞ、千早！）", "zh": "（糟糕，好像笑到停不下来了……不过，千早，你笑得真好看！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
